                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "{A疑惑}那个嘛……我的田旁边，\n有一桶“非常非常非常美味的菜”是啥子？",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1999990030_1583461853_content",
                "value": "{A疑惑}那个嘛……我的田旁边，\n有一桶“非常非常非常美味的菜”是啥子？",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1583461853
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "Actor0",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1999990030_1583461854_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "就是放在那个桶里面，\n什么都有的，散发出奇妙气味的，\n嗯呜？大乱炖？",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1999990030_1583461854_content",
                "value": "就是放在那个桶里面，\n什么都有的，散发出奇妙气味的，\n嗯呜？大乱炖？",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1583461854
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "Actor1",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
