                "textId": "Performance_1999990030_1583461855_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "桶、奇妙气味好、好像是……\n{A豆豆眼}我准备用来配肥的剩饭~？！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1999990030_1583461855_content",
                "value": "桶、奇妙气味好、好像是……\n{A豆豆眼}我准备用来配肥的剩饭~？！",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
